:: pc {"position":"825,950"}
<<scenery pc>>
welcome to your computer.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<slaveEvents BedRoom>>
    <<keyOption [[Leave your computer|bed]] 💻>>
    <<keyOption [[Watch porn|porn1]] 💗>>: 30min
    <<keyOption [[Shop online |onlineStore]] 🛒>>
    <<keyOption [[Tor Browser |DarkStore]] 🌐>>
    <<keyOption [[change your name |changenames]]  💬>>
<</unlessEmergency>>\

:: changenames {"position":"950,950"}
<<set _dialogTitle = 'Change ' + $player.name + " name to:";>>\
<<dialog _dialogTitle>>\
    <<textbox '_newName' $player.name>>
    <span id="enterAct">\
        <<button "✅ (Enter) your">>\
            <<run
            if(!$player.originalName)
                $player.originalName = $player.name;
            _mewName = _newName.trim();
            $player.name = _newName ? _newName : $player.originalName;
            Engine.show();
            Dialog.close();
            >>\
        <</button>>\
    </span>\
    <span id="escAct">\
        <<button "❌ (Esc) Cancel">>\
            <<run Dialog.close()>>\
        <</button>>\
    </span>\
    <<run $(document).ready(function(){$('#textbox--newname').focus()})>>\
<</dialog>>
<<include pc>>
